{"id":"01_5550","type":"item","name":{"ja":"30MF リーベルランサー","en":"30MF Liber Lancer"},"description":[{"ja":"（2024/12/20記載）諸般の都合により、商品の発売月を変更させていただきました。","en":"(Posted on 2024/12/20) Due to various circumstances, we have changed the product release."},{"ja":"自分だけのファンタジージョブを創り出すことが出来る『30 MINUTES FANTASY』より、「リーベルランサー」が登場！","en":"\"Liber Lancer \" is now available from \" 30 MINUTES FANTASY\", where you can create your own fantasy job!"},{"ja":"• ベースとなる“シルエット”［素体］の他にアーマー・武装パーツがひとつになったスターターセット。","en":"• A starter set that includes armor and armed parts in addition to the base \"silhouette\" [elementary body]."},{"ja":"• 別売りの「30MF リーベルナイト」と同様のフォルムの“シルエット”［素体］が付属。","en":"• A “silhouette” [body] with the same form as the separately sold “30MF Liber Knight” is included."},{"ja":"• “シルエット”［素体］は人間のような柔軟性のあるアクションが可能であらゆるジョブに適応。","en":"• The “silhouette” [elementary body] is capable of flexible human-like actions and is adaptable to any job."},{"ja":"• 頭部・首に可動軸を設けることで顎を引く、顔を突き出すなどの演出が可能。","en":"• By providing movable axes in the head and neck, it is possible to pull the chin, stick out the face, etc."},{"ja":"• 肩関節は、こだわりの構造により大胆なポージングでも身体のラインが崩れない。","en":"• The shoulder joint has a carefully designed structure that maintains the body's line even in bold poses."},{"ja":"• 胸・胴・腰の可動軸と腰ジョイントの根元のスライド機構が連動し、自然なポージングを実現。","en":"• The movable axes of the chest, torso, and waist work together with the sliding mechanism at the base of the waist joint to create natural poses."},{"ja":"• “シルエット”［素体］と組み合わせ「リーベルランサー」へ“ジョブチェンジ”するためのアーマー・武装パーツが付属。","en":"• Comes with armor and armed parts to “job change” to “Liber Lancer” in combination with “Silhouette” [base body]."},{"ja":"• 武装には「ランス」と「シールド」が付属。","en":"• \"Lance \" and \" Seal\" are included as weapons."},{"ja":"• 肩や腰アーマーの取り付けを背中のジョイントを経由する機構にすることで、フレキシブルな可動を実現。","en":"• Flexible movement is achieved by attaching the shoulder and waist armor via the joints on the back."},{"ja":"• “エレメントコア”の属性は「雷」。","en":"• The attribute of “element core” is “lightning”."},{"ja":"• 別売りのローザン帝国の「シルエット」「ランサー」とは異なるフェイスデザインとカラーリング。","en":"• Face design and coloring different from Rozan Empire's \"Silhouette \" and \" Lancer\" sold separately."}],"accessories":[{"ja":"ランス×1","en":"Lance x1"},{"ja":"シールド×1","en":"Seal × 1"},{"ja":"アーマーパーツ×1式","en":"Armor parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"ハンドパーツ×1式","en":"Hand parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"ジョイントパーツ×1式","en":"Joint parts x 1 set"}],"contents":[],"images":["https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/05/Wo71vW0YfKbXPOip/eRSFYAKYjug3Rnsh.jpg?Expires=1765044068&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=Ojsy-X9QJkgvKo2f6tj~qAN165M8JxmeDiW5EJScAdgexUj9v3vf02FO3GoyDg3m7m2AtGkELmciDQa8cYn~awWDBvox23UdTcNDwAFETi0AZxH2ILb55GQlhDQRrd0lZdK360SGgt-Qsgf8eLUKsDcFT2-nWU4~whwRayfNRKDfayNaoQ9e02d4ZpGZEa3xJ~HFKNcQpDQOu239KZkmUT27G~p6nKuwSxOPkxgdD~QUQB1aC4RISpUMfwQxhiFn5ScHy2gYhk5kZPu1rROvW57kfBzdbuo8t7dx8~IBfo5KDzzlPT7mirbiN5cBcmWc6G10m6lH3yyvqgYs8Yow~Q__","https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/05/oh5ZvSRQeac6jxGz/yQqRxdpPH1QwAr6W.jpg?Expires=1765044068&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=XkPhIcn7Z927syDfm3xv~Z4lT2oAUicFKNuLXRQjFi-uymNbr1DfcOWdgkm3kBm2XtVVTkCxPQQ7~fxcFiEU2XrJd3HBsQoltWUyfAw-ef~R-QnDnNIff~J6i8ADw~vNLv63qben6NKkVBH-8lxhhiReurhiIj2xgSt0JFiLK9TupRsGIRyiT1NlFK-2je~LctYQK3fI2C~W~UsbQh0ZSMgfbfJOvbP-dVMLxF-JrWVyM7tJfYvX40rL-eDB9dEeW~n9Ags-Hh3lscJPeH2AIu1BfFKQE8Xareq4O7MQGsZm1ABLlNHdxTVMP6Cv8AXI2KfE8U3iHxikW55CoCUR9Q__","https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/05/HxpuozTFaA3Suro9/7i6crORQb1upwJQX.jpg?Expires=1765044068&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=gfQBL1d4Ar3geKMJjFou8e~vOh8bxogK~FfnCEq14-tfCYe3tqFDqnfovqdqaTXiVSZKYTsFoBviXFOZA8pr~4ahYMjg4zr8MOYVyEQUUEzw2WFhyTtfCdqmoFCcBZNZvVJnGrbv2NCvBoVH6C-QzGUCwVrlPUVWQO1ENWn91oAst8bJdLCGAMXdH1VnMl8FI9ddJY6x4rAvnKSScnszKIT5fN0stqS7KLR-p7pGEH218GR7OMCbwgz0ajToiFyrop~A6X26bMh1SxpcuPgL2757oLfn2BVZoH88SM-H1zvt2U7opMvofRzxAnbUdbff~p0ooBVWCNf8OZDfWiRu1w__","https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/05